        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    net_income = 1_500_000\n    preferred_stock_par_value = 2_000_000\n    preferred_dividend_rate = 0.07\n    bond_par_value = 10_000_000\n    bond_coupon_rate = 0.04\n    tax_rate = 0.30\n    common_shares = 1_000_000\n    convertible_bond_shares = 300_000\n\n    preferred_dividends = preferred_stock_par_value * preferred_dividend_rate\n    after_tax_interest_saved = (\n        bond_par_value * bond_coupon_rate * (1 - tax_rate)\n    )\n\n    diluted_income = (\n        net_income\n        - preferred_dividends\n        + after_tax_interest_saved\n    )\n    diluted_shares = common_shares + convertible_bond_shares\n\n    diluted_eps = diluted_income / diluted_shares\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to three decimal places\n    return round(diluted_eps, 3)\n```",
